---
import Layout from '@/components/migration/Page.astro';
import StructuralGridHero from '@/components/migration/StructuralGridHero.astro';
import ZoltServiceMatrix from '@/components/migration/ZoltServiceMatrix.astro';
import BlogLatestPosts from '@/components/migration/BlogLatestPosts.astro';
import Button from '@/components/shared/ui/button.astro';
const metadata = {
  title: 'Phoenix Web Development & Digital Marketing Agency | ZiaFlow',
  description:
    'Phoenix web development, SEO, and lead follow-up automation for Arizona service businesses. Connect your website, inquiries, and CRM with ZiaFlow.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <StructuralGridHero />
  <ZoltServiceMatrix />
  <section class="shell" aria-labelledby="project-process">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
      <h2 id="project-process">Start with one business problem.</h2>
      <p>
        A missed inquiry, an unclear service page, or a manual handoff is a useful place to begin. We review what
        happens today before recommending a project.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>1. Review the current process</h3>
        <p>
          Discuss your goal, current tools, and where work gets stuck. If a deeper assessment is needed, we agree its
          scope and fee first.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>2. Agree the scope</h3>
        <p>
          Define deliverables, price, client responsibilities, and how you will approve the work. Implementation starts
          after the agreement, required payment, and access are in place.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>3. Build, test, and hand over</h3>
        <p>
          Review the work against the agreed checks. Get instructions for using it, with any ongoing support defined
          separately.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="shell">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Data-Driven Content Strategy</p>
      <h2>Plan content around customer questions.</h2>
      <p>
        Review search data, existing pages, and your service offering to decide what to update and what to write next.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Content Review</h3>
        <p>Check existing pages for relevant information, navigation, metadata, and contact paths.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Editorial Workflow</h3>
        <p>Define topics, source material, review responsibilities, and publishing steps.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="shell">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>Services, process, and project scope.</p>
    </header>
    <details>
      <summary>Do you work with businesses outside Arizona?</summary>
      <p>
        ZiaFlow is based in Phoenix and works with businesses across the United States through remote collaboration.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How do you measure success?</summary>
      <p>
        We agree on acceptance criteria and the events or outcomes your existing systems can measure before
        implementation.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What is included in marketing automation?</summary>
      <p>
        The scope can include inquiry capture, assignment, scheduling, and reviewed follow-up workflows. Each project
        defines the systems, access, and responsibilities involved.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Do I need a new website or CRM?</summary>
      <p>
        Not necessarily. We first review your existing setup. A focused improvement to a form, service page, or
        follow-up process may be enough.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What should I bring to the first conversation?</summary>
      <p>
        Your website, the problem you want to solve, the tools you use, and any budget or timing constraints. You do not
        need a technical specification to start.
      </p>
    </details>
  </section>
  <section class="shell">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2>What needs to work better?</h2>
      <p>Tell us where inquiries or day-to-day work get stuck. We will review the fit and discuss the next step.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="actions">
      <Button label="Discuss your project" href="/contact" />
      <Button label="Call (602) 834-4239" href="tel:+16028344239" variant="outline" />
    </div>
    <p>
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@ziaflow.com">
        info@ziaflow.com
      </a>{' '}
      · Phoenix, Arizona
    </p>
  </section>
  <BlogLatestPosts
    title="Digital Marketing Insights"
    information="Local SEO, automation, conversion, and web development articles."
  />
</Layout>
